  "description": "SPEC_21 section 4 canonical schema for professional_eo, professional liability and errors and omissions (L1 code professional_eo), composing common_model.json 1.1.0 by $ref: the envelope plus the claims_made_terms block. Built from the single-LOB professional liability declarations of the source-data pl folder (Benchmark, Coterie, CNA's Epack Extra media liability, Hartford's Premier Choice tax preparer and design professionals declarations, Nationwide (Scottsdale) and Travelers' lawyers professional liability), read in place, and the eo folder's errors and omissions declarations (Mount Vernon's specified professions renewals, Navigators' accountants and Swiss Re's insurance agencies professional liability). Every field of the pre-SPEC_21 professional_eo.json (professional_eo.crosswalk.yaml). No LOB block.",
