    "claims_made_terms.retroactive_date <= policy.effective_date",
    "len(coverages[].limits[]) >= 1"
  ],
  "fideon:audit_rules_note": "Rules 1-5 are common_model.json fideon:default_audit_rules, the claims-made rule kept: professional liability is written claims made. A rule whose values a document does not print is not evaluated.",
